          "type": "html",
          "id": "commune-transparente-actions",
          "props": {
            "html": "<section class=\"py-16 px-4 bg-white\"><div class=\"container mx-auto max-w-5xl\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-stretch\"><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center h-full text-center\"><img src=\"/images/communeTransparente/ct-illustration.png\" alt=\"Commune Transparente\" class=\"w-64 h-auto mb-6 rounded-xl\" /><h3 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-indigo-700 uppercase tracking-wide mb-4\">COMMUNE TRANSPARENTE</h3><p class=\"text-base md:text-lg text-slate-600 text-center mb-3\">Favoriser la transparence et l'accès à l'information publique au sein de votre commune. Nous présentons ici des rubriques dédiées aux actions municipales, aux projets en cours, aux décisions publiques et aux données ouvertes.</p><p class=\"text-base md:text-lg font-semibold text-slate-800 text-center italic\">Une expérience claire et accessible, pensée pour renforcer la confiance et l'implication citoyenne.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col divide-y divide-slate-200\"><details class=\"py-6 group\"><summary class=\"flex items-center gap-3 cursor-pointer list-none select-none\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-blue-500 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-white\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 8v4l3 3\"/></svg></div><span class=\"font-bold text-base md:text-lg uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-700\">PARTAGE DE RESSOURCES</span><span class=\"ml-auto text-slate-400 transition-transform group-open:rotate-90\">›</span></summary><div class=\"pt-2 pb-1 pl-11\"><p class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-slate-500 mb-3\">Trouvez du soutien près de chez vous. Postez votre demande et laissez la communauté vous aider.</p><a href=\"/ressources/nouveau\" class=\"inline-block px-4 py-2 bg-indigo-600 text-white text-sm md:text-base font-semibold rounded-md hover:bg-indigo-700 transition-all\">Proposer une ressource</a></div></details><details class=\"py-6 group\"><summary class=\"flex items-center gap-3 cursor-pointer list-none select-none\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-slate-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-white\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6 2 3 6v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6l-3-4z\"/><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"6\"/><path d=\"M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0\"/></svg></div><span class=\"font-bold text-base md:text-lg uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-700\">BESOINS &amp; DEMANDES</span><span class=\"ml-auto text-slate-400 transition-transform group-open:rotate-90\">›</span></summary><div class=\"pt-2 pb-1 pl-11\"><p class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-slate-500 mb-3\">Vous avez des compétences ou du temps ? Proposez vos services pour aider votre quartier.</p><a href=\"/offres/nouveau\" class=\"inline-block px-4 py-2 bg-indigo-600 text-white text-sm md:text-base font-semibold rounded-md hover:bg-indigo-700 transition-all\">Proposer une offre</a></div></details><details class=\"py-6 group\"><summary class=\"flex items-center gap-3 cursor-pointer list-none select-none\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-purple-500 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-white\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"/></svg></div><span class=\"font-bold text-base md:text-lg uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-700\">PROPOSER UNE IDÉE</span><span class=\"ml-auto text-slate-400 transition-transform group-open:rotate-90\">›</span></summary><div class=\"pt-2 pb-1 pl-11\"><p class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-slate-500 mb-3\">Accédez à l'annuaire des associations, commerces et services utiles de votre territoire.</p><a href=\"/idees/nouveau\" class=\"inline-block px-4 py-2 bg-indigo-600 text-white text-sm md:text-base font-semibold rounded-md hover:bg-indigo-700 transition-all\">Proposer une offre</a></div></details><details class=\"py-6 group\"><summary class=\"flex items-center gap-3 cursor-pointer list-none select-none\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-green-500 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-white\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"/></svg></div><span class=\"font-bold text-base md:text-lg uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-700\">PROJETS LOCAUX</span><span class=\"ml-auto text-slate-400 transition-transform group-open:rotate-90\">›</span></summary><div class=\"pt-2 pb-1 pl-11\"><p class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-slate-500 mb-3\">Présentez votre projet local pour trouver des soutiens, des bénévoles et des partenaires.</p><div class=\"flex gap-2\"><a href=\"/projets/nouveau\" class=\"inline-block px-4 py-2 bg-indigo-600 text-white text-sm md:text-base font-semibold rounded-md hover:bg-indigo-700 transition-all\">Proposer un projet</a><a href=\"/projets\" class=\"inline-block px-4 py-2 bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-700 text-sm md:text-base font-semibold rounded-md hover:bg-indigo-200 transition-all\">Les Projets locaux</a></div></div></details><details class=\"py-6 group\"><summary class=\"flex items-center gap-3 cursor-pointer list-none select-none\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-blue-700 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-white\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z\"/><polyline points=\"9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22\"/></svg></div><span class=\"font-bold text-base md:text-lg uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-700\">ENTREPRISES LOCALES</span><span class=\"ml-auto text-slate-400 transition-transform group-open:rotate-90\">›</span></summary><div class=\"pt-2 pb-1 pl-11\"><p class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-slate-500 mb-3\">Faites connaître une association, un club ou un collectif en l'ajoutant à notre annuaire local.</p><a href=\"/organisations/nouveau\" class=\"inline-block px-4 py-2 bg-indigo-600 text-white text-sm md:text-base font-semibold rounded-md hover:bg-indigo-700 transition-all\">Proposer une organisation</a></div></details><details class=\"py-6 group\"><summary class=\"flex items-center gap-3 cursor-pointer list-none select-none\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-orange-500 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-white\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"6\"/><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"6\"/><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"10\"/></svg></div><span class=\"font-bold text-base md:text-lg uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-700\">ÉVÉNEMENT</span><span class=\"ml-auto text-slate-400 transition-transform group-open:rotate-90\">›</span></summary><div class=\"pt-2 pb-1 pl-11\"><p class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-slate-500 mb-3\">Annoncez un concert, marché ou réunion d'information pour le partager avec les habitants.</p><div class=\"flex gap-2\"><a href=\"/evenements/nouveau\" class=\"inline-block px-4 py-2 bg-indigo-600 text-white text-sm md:text-base font-semibold rounded-md hover:bg-indigo-700 transition-all\">Proposer un événement</a><a href=\"/evenements\" class=\"inline-block px-4 py-2 bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-700 text-sm md:text-base font-semibold rounded-md hover:bg-indigo-200 transition-all\">Les Événements</a></div></div></details><details class=\"py-6 group\"><summary class=\"flex items-center gap-3 cursor-pointer list-none select-none\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-green-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-white\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"5\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"19\"/><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"19\" y2=\"12\"/></svg></div><span class=\"font-bold text-base md:text-lg uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-700\">PROPOSITION</span><span class=\"ml-auto text-slate-400 transition-transform group-open:rotate-90\">›</span></summary><div class=\"pt-2 pb-1 pl-11\"><p class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-slate-500 mb-3\">Vous avez une idée pour améliorer votre commune ? Proposez-la et trouvez des soutiens pour la réaliser.</p><a href=\"/propositions/nouveau\" class=\"inline-block px-4 py-2 bg-indigo-600 text-white text-sm md:text-base font-semibold rounded-md hover:bg-indigo-700 transition-all\">Partage de Propositions</a></div></details></div></div></div></section>"
          }
